  "description": "WOBBBLE — A Bubble Y2K Font Full of Fun & Funk! Say hello to WOBBBLE, a bold and playful bubble font inspired by the iconic Y2K aesthetic. With its wobbly curves, chunky forms, and bouncy attitude, WOBBBLE typeface brings back the energy of early 2000s pop culture—think retro tech, bubbly graphics, and pure fun. Designed as a display typeface, WOBBBLE is perfect for creating loud, memorable visuals. Whether you’re working on a brand logo, party invitation, event poster, or social media content, this font turns every project into a fun-filled experience. Features: Uppercase & Variant Number, symbol, & punctuation Multilingual OTF, TTF, WOFF, WOFF2 Bold, bubble style with unique Y2K character Wobbly and whimsical forms for playful vibes * Great for branding, logos, events, and digital content Get ready to wobble your words and bring joy to your designs!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>WOBBBLE — A Bubble Y2K Font Full of Fun &amp; Funk! Say hello to WOBBBLE, a bold and playful bubble font inspired by the iconic Y2K aesthetic. With its wobbly curves, chunky forms, and bouncy attitude, WOBBBLE typeface brings back the energy of early 2000s pop culture—think retro tech, bubbly graphics, and pure fun. Designed as a display typeface, WOBBBLE is perfect for creating loud, memorable visuals. Whether you’re working on a brand logo, party invitation, event poster, or social media content, this font turns every project into a fun-filled experience. Features: Uppercase &amp; Variant Number, symbol, &amp; punctuation Multilingual OTF, TTF, WOFF, WOFF2 Bold, bubble style with unique Y2K character Wobbly and whimsical forms for playful vibes * Great for branding, logos, events, and digital content Get ready to wobble your words and bring joy to your designs!</p>",
